<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/19/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "This Act comes into operation on a date to be appointed by the Minister by notification in the Gazette. Amendment of section 2"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/19/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/19/eng@/~cl_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#has_part> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/19/eng@/~cl_2__para_a> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/19/eng@> .
