<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/19/eng@/~cl_9> <https://schema.org/text> "The principal Act is amended in subsection 8(1) by substituting for the words “Director General” the words “Commissioner General”. Saving"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/19/eng@> .
